{"unit_id":"cpp285__dsh-plugin-center#card-zh","repo":"cpp285/dsh-plugin-center","commit":"a2e2cd7a520ceab12868aa51c5a81e2f3980a7f5","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Plugin Center（DSH 插件，网页客户端）：在“设置 → 插件”中查看、发现并管理 DeepSeek Harness 插件。它读取运行中的 Loader 清单，并提供 GitHub 搜索和精选列表。主要功能包括查看插件状态与版本、编辑中英文说明、搜索插件、安装 GitHub 或 npm 插件，以及更新和移除已安装插件。适合需要在 DSH 网页端集中整理插件的用户。GitHub 发现可选用 GITHUB_TOKEN 提高 API 请求额度，管理操作使用所选 profile 的本机 dsh 命令。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:203-250","index.js:274-328","index.js:361-424","client.js:278-343"]}
{"unit_id":"cpp285__dsh-plugin-center#card-en","repo":"cpp285/dsh-plugin-center","commit":"a2e2cd7a520ceab12868aa51c5a81e2f3980a7f5","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Plugin Center adds a Plugins page to DSH web. It shows Loader inventory and GitHub discovery and recommendations, lets users edit plugin descriptions, and supports installing, updating, and removing packages. GitHub uses optional GITHUB_TOKEN; lifecycle actions call local dsh.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:203-250","index.js:274-328","index.js:361-424","client.js:278-343"]}
